#### Example .env

ACROSS_SERVER_HOST="https://api.across.sciencecloud.nasa.gov"
# Port is really only needed for local development.
ACROSS_SERVER_PORT=""
ACROSS_SERVER_ROOT_PATH="/"
ACROSS_SERVER_VERSION="v1"

